    framework isolated (canonical): chi2 = 102.3   amplitudes = 1.32, 1.53, 1.52, 1.53
  [PASS] D4 REPORTED BOTH WAYS: which of the two shapes the KiDS profile prefers, with one free amplitude each   (NFW chi2 = 270.9 vs framework-isolated chi2 = 102.3 on 60 points with 4 amplitudes each; difference +168.6)

